<SMSLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="JenkinsHQ privacy practices and SMS consent handling.">
<p class="overline">JenkinsHQ</p><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p class="muted">Last updated November 7, 2026</p>
<h2>Who this policy applies to</h2><p>This policy covers JenkinsHQ's customer inquiry and transactional SMS notification program hosted at this website. It does not replace the separate privacy policy governing other services offered on this website.</p>
<h2>Information collected</h2><p>When you voluntarily submit our JenkinsHQ contact form, we collect the name, email address, optional mobile phone number, service request description, and whether you checked the SMS opt-in box. The form also submits a version identifier for the SMS disclosure. Our hosting and messaging providers may process technical and delivery information necessary to operate the service.</p>
<h2>How information is used</h2><p>We use the information to respond to customer inquiries, provide requested services, process or update relevant customer orders, arrange appointments, and send service-related messages only where messaging consent has been obtained. We may retain consent and opt-out records to help honor your choices and meet legal obligations.</p>
<h2>Mobile data and consent</h2><p><strong>We do not sell or share mobile numbers, SMS opt-in data, or SMS consent information with third parties or affiliates for their marketing or promotional purposes.</strong> We may use hosting, customer-service, or messaging processors only to deliver the services you request. Text messaging originator opt-in data and consent are not shared with any third parties for their marketing purposes.</p>
<h2>Your choices</h2><p>SMS opt-in is optional and is not a condition of purchase. Reply STOP to discontinue the JenkinsHQ SMS program or HELP for assistance. You may contact <a href="mailto:Jeremi.Jenkins@gmail.com">Jeremi.Jenkins@gmail.com</a> to request access, correction, or deletion as applicable.</p>
<h2>Retention and security</h2><p>Information is retained only as needed for service delivery, recordkeeping, consent verification, or legal compliance, subject to applicable requirements. We use reasonable safeguards; no online system can guarantee absolute security.</p>
<h2>Policy updates and contact</h2><p>We may update this policy to reflect operational or legal changes and will revise the date above. For questions, email <a href="mailto:Jeremi.Jenkins@gmail.com">Jeremi.Jenkins@gmail.com</a> or submit a request through our <a href="/jenkinshq/sms">contact and opt-in form</a>.</p>
</SMSLayout>